    98	  for a surgical assessment, with or without other health conditions. A
    99	  range of procedures may be suitable, and your surgeon will discuss the
   100	  options most appropriate for your situation.</span>
   101	
   102	- <span class="mark">BMI 40+: almost everyone in this range is eligible
   103	  for surgery and for many patients it represents the most effective
   104	  long-term pathway available. Your surgeon can confirm which procedure
   105	  is the right fit.</span>
   106	
