The source sweep found the key residuals: the BMI 35–39 “with or without” claim, the BMI 30–34 surgery pathway wording, “regardless of BMI” comorbidity language, a repeated mental-health assurance, a private-cover “significant portion” claim, a second GLP-1 mention, “leading” hospital marketing, and four visible scaffold artifacts. I’m applying those as paste-ready review fixes and tightening the brief’s inherited BMI, safety, funding, and pending-policy directions.
